    "title": "Lauren Sánchez Goes Wild With Braless Look in Sheer Animal Print Dress - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Lauren Sánchez is taking a walk on her wild side, spicing things up with a maxi-length dress that manages to leave almost nothing to the imagination. The thinnest straps possible held the garment up, which started off with an asymmetrical section made of a sheer leopard print fabric underneath which she appeared to wear no bra, as seen in new photos published by Page Six . The left side of the section stopped at the bottom of her waist, while the right side fell to the top of her thigh. The next section was a thick diagonal strip of sheer lace, which then attached to a see-through zebra-print segment. The back of the dress left her entire back bare, save for the thin straps that crisscrossed underneath her neck. The open back fell in a low V to just above her bum, which was clad in a pair of black panties. She opted for a neutral makeup look with her hair pulled back into an updo, leaving just a few strands framing her face, and completed the look with a pair of black open-toed block heels. Sánchez clung to her groom's hand in the photos, which were taken on Wednesday night, July 23, in St. Tropez, France, with Jeff Bezos dressed in a deep blue velour polo tucked into black pants with a pair of blue-green boat shoes. Related: Lauren Sánchez, 55, Turns Heads in Impossibly Tiny Waist-Cinching Mini Dress",
